WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:04.897
Hello, everyone! I'm Ms. Emma. Welcome to Online B two, Book three.

2
00:00:05.197 --> 00:00:08.572
Hi! I'm Visal. Let's learn together!

3
00:00:08.872 --> 00:00:14.160
Unit two: Independent Learning. Today you will turn verbs into nouns with nominalization.

4
00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:16.903
Here is our lesson map. Let's start!

5
00:00:17.867 --> 00:00:21.111
