34
00:02:01.117 --> 00:02:04.082
Your turn. Say: Self-regulation.

35
00:02:06.933 --> 00:02:08.422
Self-regulation.

36
00:02:09.183 --> 00:02:10.951
Research independence.

37
00:02:11.950 --> 00:02:15.482
Research independence means finding information on your own.

38
00:02:16.083 --> 00:02:18.954
