49
00:02:57.917 --> 00:03:00.557
Your turn. Say: Metacognition.

50
00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:04.564
Metacognition.

51
00:03:05.317 --> 00:03:07.130
Knowledge-seeking.

52
00:03:08.117 --> 00:03:11.126
